== Effects ==
* Turns items, trinkets, and pickups in the room into {{e|Penny|text=Coins}}, essentially selling them.
** All items will be sold for {{pennies|15}}, including items that usually have a different price in the shop, such as {{i|R Key}}.
** Other pickups and trinkets are sold for their normal {{r|Shop}} price.
** If there is nothing to sell, drops a single {{e|Penny}}.

