== Notes ==
* [[Chest]]s cannot be sold.
* Selling an item in a {{r|Boss Challenge Room}} or {{r|Boss Rush}} does ''not'' cause waves of bosses to spawn.
* If used in a room with a choice of multiple item pedestals, only one of the choice objects will be sold and the rest will disappear.

== Strategy ==
* For maximum profit, any card, rune, pill or trinket should be gathered to the same room before using '''IX - The Hermit?'''.
* Since cheap or discounted shop items are still converted to the full 15 cents, this can be used to generate profit.

== Synergies ==
* {{I|Tarot Cloth}}: Spawns 1 additional {{e|Penny}}.
* {{i|Moving Box}}: Allows for transport of items and pickups to the same room. Making more money from one use of '''IX - The Hermit?'''.

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Dad's Note}}: Not affected by '''IX - The Hermit?'''. If the room only has Dad's Note, a {{e|Penny}} will spawn.
* {{c|Tainted ???}}: Poop pickups can't be sold.

